# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows/macOS 之间来回转换把整文件标成改动
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换，也不做文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.epub binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
